  hint: Found outside the Kieller museum
  characterDescription: "Bluetit\r\nFound outside the Kieller museum\r\nOutfit inspired
    by Alexander Kieller\r\nTerrance is absolutely fascinated by the archaeological
    history of avebury, and his knowledge led to him deciding the costumes for himself,
    Bobby and Steve. When not reading books or looking in the museum he often can
    be found discussing what he\u2019s learned with Harry the hedgehog, or quietly
    drinking tea with his friends.\r\n"
